
:SPECIAL_TASK
"gives $obj_np(NP) to $rec_np(NP)"  /pres give $obj_np(NP) $rec_np(NP)     .
"gave $obj_np(NP) to $rec_np(NP)"   /past give $obj_np(NP) $rec_np(NP)     .

:TRANS_TASK
"gets"                          /pres get                       .
"got"                           /past get                       .

; A task under way, as the progressive after "is": the reason a busy man gives. Its target is
